@startuml centralAppControllerStateMachine
state Uninitialized
state Idle
state Processing
state Error

[*] --> Uninitialized

Uninitialized --> Idle : Init()\n/ Init all downstream modules

Idle --> Processing : Dispatch()\n/ Parse request
Processing --> Idle : Response built successfully
Processing --> Error : Dispatch failure

Idle --> Idle : Run()\n/ periodic tick (no-op currently)
Error --> Idle : Run()\n/ auto-recover

Idle --> Uninitialized : DeInit()
Error --> Uninitialized : DeInit()

note right of Idle
  GetState() returns IDLE.
  RegisterErrorCallback() stores callback.
  Dispatch() triggers parse -> route -> respond.
end note

note right of Error
  GetState() returns ERROR.
  ErrorCallback invoked if registered.
end note
@enduml